      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DROPPING BOMBS (8) has an honest record despite remaining a maiden and overdue for a win, having placed eight of 15 career runs. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. CANYA CHIRPY (7) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fifth (31.24) at this track in a Mix. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. ROSE VIOLET (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (30.62) in a Grade 5 at The Gardens. Strong form has emerged from her last run. One of the better chances. GLENREAGH TEARS (2) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
